#: includes/class-feasible-admin.php:247
msgid "With the proxy on, the tracking script bundled with this plugin and the event endpoint are served from paths on this site rather than from feasible.lol. Each event is checked and rebuilt here before it is forwarded, with the visitor's real address so the numbers stay correct."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-feasible-admin.php:248
msgid "The paths are random and specific to this site. That means a filter list naming one path costs one site rather than every site using this plugin. It raises the cost of being blocked; it does not end it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-feasible-admin.php:257
msgid "The snippet is added to the front end of the site. Turn it off if you paste the script into your theme yourself."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-feasible-admin.php:267
msgid "Site searches and 404s are measured by this plugin, because only WordPress knows a page was a 404 and how many results a search returned."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-feasible-admin.php:276
