msgid "Serve the script and the event endpoint from this domain"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-feasible-admin.php:343
msgid "With this off, the snippet loads the script from your feasible.lol host directly and the browser sends events there. That works; it is simply easier to block."
msgstr ""

