#: includes/class-feasible-admin.php:368
msgid "This site uses plain permalinks, so nothing rewrites a bare path to WordPress and a path route would be a 404 before any PHP runs. Switch to any other permalink setting and these become real paths, which look less like tracking."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-feasible-admin.php:373
msgid "Rotate paths"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-feasible-admin.php:374
msgid "Rotating generates new random paths and rewrites the rules behind them. It is the remedy when a path ends up on a filter list. Anything caching the old script URL will fetch the new one on its next page load."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-feasible-admin.php:383
msgid "Add the tracking snippet to the front end"
